          {
            "title": "Question: del",
            "id": 96242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué imprimirá el siguiente código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>salad</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, se mostrará un error</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>chips</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>salad</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Después de ejecutar <code>del meal[-1]</code>, ¿qué afirmación describe <code>meal</code> y <code>side</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">meal ya no contiene salad, pero side aún almacena salad</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tanto meal como side pierden el valor salad</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">meal aún contiene salad porque side almacena el mismo valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">meal ya no contiene salad, pero side aún almacena salad.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del list item",
            "id": 96244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>del</code> para eliminar el último elemento en <code>shopping</code> si la lista tiene más de 3 elementos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;oranges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemons&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;beans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(shopping) &gt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bananas', 'oranges', 'lemons', 'carrots']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>del shopping[-1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: del uses",
            "id": 96247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> se puede usar para eliminar cuál de los siguientes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cualquier referencia de objeto, incluidos los elementos dentro de estructuras de datos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo partes de una lista</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo pares clave:valor en un diccionario</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cualquier referencia de objeto, incluidos los elementos dentro de estructuras de datos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> puede eliminar una referencia a un objeto, incluido un elemento dentro de una estructura de datos.</p><p>Si <code>scores</code> almacena una lista, ¿qué par puede ser objetivo válido de <code>del</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">scores y scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo scores[0], porque las variables no se pueden eliminar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo scores, porque los elementos de una lista no se pueden eliminar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir scores y scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del object",
            "id": 96245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa el código para que <code>cookies</code> se elimine si el último elemento en la tupla <code>permissions</code> es <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>-</code> seguido de <code>1</code> y luego <code>del</code>, <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elimina <code>cookies</code> cuando el elemento <strong>final</strong> de la tupla <code>permissions</code> sea <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>-</code> seguido de <code>1</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>del</code> y finalmente <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: clean dict",
            "id": 96246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa el código para eliminar a <code>Jason</code> del diccionario <code>users</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>del</code> seguido de <code>users</code> y finalmente <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elimina del diccionario al usuario cuyo rol es <code>Apprentice</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>del</code> seguido de <code>users</code> y finalmente <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: negative stepping",
            "id": 96337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa el código para que se imprima <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>2</code> seguido de <code>-</code> y finalmente <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parte de <code>H</code> con índice negativo, para antes de <code>2</code> y retrocede de dos en dos: <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>-2</code> seguido de <code>2</code>, <code>-</code> y finalmente <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start values",
            "id": 96330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué temperaturas se imprimirán?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Todos ellos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ninguno - se producirá un error</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Todos excepto el primero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Todos ellos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué expresión da solo las dos últimas temperaturas, <code>[12, 11]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[2:]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[-2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>temperatures[-2:]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: stop values",
            "id": 96332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál de las siguientes afirmaciones es verdadera sobre el valor de <code>end</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>end</code> puede ser cualquier número entero, positivo o negativo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un valor de <code>end</code> siempre debe ser incluido</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El valor de <code>end</code> debe ser mayor que el valor de <code>start</code> para evitar que se produzca un error</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>end</code> puede ser cualquier número entero, positivo o negativo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El valor <code>end</code> de una porción puede ser un entero positivo o negativo, y también puede omitirse.</p><p>En <code>letters[1:-1]</code>, ¿qué hace <code>-1</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Marca la última posición como el final excluido</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hace que la porción no sea válida porque end es negativo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invierte la porción automáticamente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Marca la última posición como el final excluido.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start:stop:step",
            "id": 96339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué letras serán impresas por el siguiente código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>B</code> solamente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No se imprimirá nada</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>A</code> y <code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>B</code> solamente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La salida de abajo corresponde a la porción tal como está escrita. ¿Qué contendría <code>selection</code> si la porción fuera <code>alphabet[-2:-1:-1]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una lista vacía</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B', 'A']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir Una lista vacía.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: negative stepping",
            "id": 96340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
