            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué valores imprimirá el siguiente código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"words = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;I&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;do&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;not&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;love&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;you&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(words[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"::\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(words[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"::])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['do', 'I']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['love', 'you']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['do', 'I']</code> y luego <code>['love', 'you']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['do]</code> y luego <code>['you', 'love']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['I']</code> y luego <code>['love', 'you']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['do', 'I']</code> y luego <code>['love', 'you']</code>.</p></body></html>",
